		<div class="cs-entry__content-wrap">
			
			<div class="entry-content">
				
<figure class="wp-block-image is-resized"><img decoding="async" width="207" height="84" src="https://www.wrestleview.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/image-38.png" alt="" class="wp-image-354572" style="aspect-ratio:2.4642857142857144;width:207px;height:auto"/></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>WWE SmackDown Results<br>November 27, 2026<br><strong>Wichita, Kansas (Intrust Bank Arena)</strong><br>Commentary: Michael Cole and Corey Graves<br>Results by: Roy Nemer of Wrestleview.com</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">WWE SmackDown kicks off with clips of Raw where Cody Rhodes announced that Seth Rollins will be on Team USA at the Survivor Series.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In the arena, CM Punk&#8217;s music hits and out he comes to the ring. He talks about Thanksgiving and says that happy is not the word he is feeling right now. Punk says his genius captain Cody Rhodes picked Seth Rollins for his team. He says he is not pleased but what is a little shocking is that he is not mad. He says he is disappointed in his friend Cody, annoyed, incredibly. He says sometimes he forgets how much fun this business can be.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">He says he had American socks on, his face painted, he was in the ring with Hacksaw Jim Duggan without the pressure of being Champion and now it feels like all of the air has been taken out of the room.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Cody&#8217;s music hits and out he comes to the ring. Cody asks him if he wants him to apologize. Punk says he doesn&#8217;t have to apologize. Cody tells him that this is someone that revolutionized the business, one of the best of all time and someone who gives them a best time to win. Punk tells him he is crazy for saying that he revolutionized the business and he asks Cody if he is onm crack.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Punk says he wants to win but this is not worth it, this is not the price that he was willing to pay. Cody says for someone who taught him so much in his career why is he the one telling him that this doesn&#8217;t look like or sound like CM Punk of old. The CM Punk who holds a grudge for no reason. He says it is no secret that he is adored by the entire locker room, that one day he might run the show, it is no secret.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">He says that is the CM Punk he loves and they know. He says he is not trying to make Punk feel better about the situation ,he knows that he has a problem with Seth Rollins. He says he doesn&#8217;t want Punk to be mad at Seth, he wants him to be mad at him. Punk says he is mad at Cody and he should be mad at himself for picking Seth. He tells him not to mention anything that Seth has done or said to him in the last 10 years. Punk says LA Knight is not thrilled, he thinks J&#8217;Veon maybe is happy to just be there. HE says it&#8217;s not just about him, out of the blue, Seth is suddenly patriotic. Punk says Seth is doing this not to win but for one reason and that is to piss him off.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Seth&#8217;s music hits and out he comes to the ring with a 2&#215;4 stick. Seth welcomes everyone to the show. Seth says he has missed the fans, he missed being out in the ring, the energy, the burn it down. The fans start to sing his song and Seth asks them to sing it louder for CM Punk. The fans begin to sing. He says it feels good to be needed and to be needed by CM Punk.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Seth tells Punk this is fun, team USA, five on five, Survivor Series match. Seth says he knows what this is about, it&#8217;s about the 2&#215;4 isn&#8217;t it. He says he picked it up because Punk dropped it on Monday but it means more to Punk than to him. Seth offers Punk the 2&#215;4, Cody grabs it and gives it to Punk. Seth says that&#8217;s step one. If it&#8217;s not the 2&#215;4, it has to be the co captain situation, that meant a lot to Punk, he says that Cody mentioned to Seth that he can be co-captain since Punk relinquished the spot but he doesn&#8217;t need it. He says Punk can be the co-captain.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">He says it&#8217;s the holiday season, if he wants to have fun, for them to have fun. He asks Punk how the family is, how is AJ and Punk gets in Seth&#8217;s face but Cody breaks it up.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">LA Knight&#8217;s music hits and out he comes to the ring. LA Knight says Seth loves to piss of Punk and Punk loves America, Cody loves to be captain but he doesn&#8217;t care. He cares about Survivor Series and they have a mission to complete. He says he wants to be the voice of reason. He tells Punk it&#8217;s one night, all he has to do is get through one night. He says if he wants to stomp Seth up, he will watch it himself. LA Knight says he looks at Seth and the best thing about him is his song and what a biblical disaster that is. Punk does LA Knight&#8217;s yeah. But Punk has to get through Survivor Series.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">He tells Cody that he wants to thank him for bringing him into the fold but at the same time Punk is right, he should be pissed at him. LA Knight says Seth was a piss poor decision. Seth gets in LA Knight&#8217;s face and out comes Je&#8217;Von Evans to the ring. He says they are fighting for something bigger. He says this is supposed to be fun. He tells Punk that this is the most fun he probably had in his career and he can probably say the same. He is teaming with people who grew up watching.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">He is teaming with the mega store, the revolutionary, the American Nightmare and the best in the world. If you ask anyone there, that is a dream team. But it&#8217;s a shame that he has to say this, he is the youngest one here and the only one acting like an adult. Cody says that&#8217;s an 8 out of 10 on the pep talk. Cody shakes LA Knight&#8217;s hand, Je&#8217;Von Evans and Seth. He goes to shake Punk&#8217;s hand but Punk oooks at him. Seth tells Punk to shake Cody&#8217;s hand. He tells Punk not to be a coward, to shake his hand or take his ball and go home again. He says they didn&#8217;t need him he walked out 15 years ago and they don&#8217;t need him now.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Punk shakes Cody&#8217;s hand and says he will see him tomorrow. He drops the microphone and leaves the ring.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A 30 years of The Rock promo airs.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Commercial Break-</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Back from commercial, CM Punk and Cody Rhodes are backstage. Cody tells Punk to take the 2&#215;4 and to keep it. Punk tells him to hold on to it, Cody is the captain. Cody tells him he needs his co-captain. Punk tells Cody he feels like he picked his co-captain. He says he will be there tomorrow, he will watch Cody&#8217;s back but for Cody to watch his because his co-captain is a snake.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>WWE Women&#8217;s Tag Team Championship match &#8211; Michin and B-Fab (c&#8217;s) with Jade Cargill vs. Alexa Bliss and Tatum Paxley with Charlotte Flair</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The bell rings and we are under way. Paxley and Michin start the match. Paxley with a double underhook suplex. She throws Michin to the ropes but B-Fab is tagged in and they double team Paxley. B-Fan with a side slam. She goes for the cover but Paxley kicks out. B-Fab goes for a kick but Paxley moves out of the way. Paxley with a knee to the face and Bliss is tagged in. Michin is tagged in. Bliss with a shoulder tackle. Bliss with a drop kick. Bliss to the ropes but B-Fab trips her up and Michin with a drop kick. Bliss rolls to the outside of the ring and Michin throws Bliss into the barricade.</p>
			</div>

